  "spec": ["power 6.1", "power 6.3", "power 6.4", "power 6.5", "power 6.6", "power 15.6", "power 15.7"],
  "description": "Tests 6 and 7, by hand from 6.3-6.6. Test 6: no plant; buy deal 1 (city 77, amount 300); PowerPole connection 1 to city 77 at cell (0,1), its other side (connection 2) active. State 2 takes the unvisited connection, marks it visited and floods from (0,1): the consumer at (2,0)-(3,1) (need 200) wires x 0..5, z 0..3. Import capacity 300 - 0 = 300, total 300 - trunc(0 x -1.1f) = 300, avail 300; the block needs 200 -> powered, avail 100 = leftover, used 200; imports take min(300, 200) = 200 -> deal used 200, import 200, consumption 200. State 3 sets each connection active iff its cell is powered: connection 1 true, connection 2 (cell 255,255) false. Test 7: plant supply 1000 (total 1100), sell deal 2 (city 88, amount 400) connected through connection 3 at (15,3): give min(400, 1100) = 400 -> exports 400, avail 700, deal used 400, and the connection cell is lit in powered-next (avail > 0); need 100 -> avail 600 = leftover; used 1100 - 600 = 500; ratio 500 / max(1000, 500) -> plant used 500; history 0xAA11F7D2 = trunc((500 - 400) x 1.0) = 100. The served deal gets no flag. Unserved: deal 3 (city 89, amount 50) connected at (100,100), a network with no supply: avail 0, give min(50, 0) = 0 -> SetFlags(0x20, true) (and the cell is not lit); in the next cycle deal 3 is not connected to the plant's network, stays unused and state 3 flags it again.",
  "steps": [
    {"op": "power_env",
      "occupants": [{"id": 41, "type": "building", "cells": [2, 0, 3, 1], "props": {"0x27812854": {"u32": 200}}}],
      "deals": [{"id": 1, "type": "buy", "city": 77, "amount": 300}],
      "connections": [{"id": 1, "city": 77, "cell": [0, 1], "other": 2}, {"id": 2, "city": 900, "cell": [255, 255], "active": true}]},
    {"op": "power_create"},
    {"op": "power_init"},
    {"op": "power_message", "type": "OccupantInserted", "occupant": 41},
    {"op": "power_message", "type": "ConnectionsReady"},
    {"op": "power_expect", "state": {"recompute": false}},
    {"op": "power_cycle", "recompute": true, "expect_calls": 5},
    {"op": "power_expect_rand", "calls": 1},
    {"op": "power_expect", "state": {"last_production": 0, "last_import": 200, "last_consumption": 200, "last_demand": 200,
      "last_export": 0, "powered": 1}},
    {"op": "power_call", "method": "monthly_import", "expect": 200},
    {"op": "power_expect_world", "deals": {"1": {"used": 200, "flags": 0}},
